{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a First Person, Colony-Survival Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your territory, build thriving villages, and strengthen your defences as rival factions vie for control of the land. Walk amongst your people as their leader, placing every building by hand, defending against raids, and personally leading the charge into enemy lands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your kingdom tile by tile with villages, resource centres, crafting hubs or strategic defences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your forces into battle, invade rival territories and defend your borders against incoming raids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, forge stronger weapons and armour for your army, or enhance your own abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your borders grow so too does your kingdom\u2019s wealth and total production.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More coming soon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832210?t=1758118128","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/dfcf2fff252f9586ea4b339daa3e7d2394951872/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758118128","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/9eb85a8541fdd714612d29bbe1fc8826faa13296/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758118128","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/9eb85a8541fdd714612d29bbe1fc8826faa13296/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758118128","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},